Subject: [PATCH v4 2/4] dt-bindings: usb: richtek,rt1711h: Switch ETEK
 ET7304 to use a fallback compatible
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: linux-usb@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <linux-usb.vger.kernel.org>
